# The player's walker, seen from above. 28x28, drawn 1:1.
#
# Radially symmetric on purpose. The player aims with the mouse and the sprite
# does not rotate, so any feature that implied a facing — a nose, a barrel —
# would be wrong most of the time. A round machine with a lit dome is right
# from every angle.
#
# Steel, not rust: everything inert in this game is cool and everything that
# can hurt you is warm, and the player is the one warm-adjacent thing that is
# on your side.
name shooter-player
size 28 28
key o outline
key S steel-1
key H steel-2
key A steel-3-hilite
pixels
